WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.053
This page is the Observations list.

00:00:02.053 --> 00:00:06.503
Search finds records by
URL, page title, region, or tag.

00:00:06.503 --> 00:00:10.334
Tag chips filter the list
by one tag, all, or untagged.

00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:12.897
A tag is saved on every
record of that URL.

00:00:12.897 --> 00:00:15.739
Share Collection lets you
pick existing Observations.

00:00:15.739 --> 00:00:18.052
Selected records become
one share link.

00:00:18.052 --> 00:00:20.454
Share Collection does not
start a new capture.

00:00:20.454 --> 00:00:26.340
The table shows capture time,
URL, region, status, tags, and Details.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.926
Press Details to open that
Observation's screenshot and record.

00:00:29.926 --> 00:00:33.074
Screenshots are deleted after
the plan retention window.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:36.027
URL, region, and time
metadata remain.
